                "text": "The Biden Administration\u2019s Medicare drug price \u201cnegotiation\u201d is a ploy to try and convince you they are lowering the cost of prescription drugs. \n\nUnfortunately, what they are not telling the American people is that the Democrats\u2019 drug price-setting will increase prescription drug prices and reduce access to more affordable, generic alternatives.\n\nhttps://t.co/qnHU1MXL3l",
