                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "MYTH:\u00a0The One Big Beautiful Bill \u201cwill close rural hospitals.\u201d\n\nFACT:\u00a0Rural hospitals comprise 7% of all hospital spending on Medicaid, illustrating that they have not benefited from the massive increase in waste, fraud, and abuse under the Biden administration. By strengthening Medicaid, we are making more resources available for vulnerable populations and safety net providers, like rural hospitals. We are expanding rural hospital protection, providing targeted funds for rural care, and giving states flexibility to support local providers.",
